  "id": "spoke-b",
  "title": "Spoke B power",
  "summary": "First playable. The hub island is open with 600 personnel. Spoke B, an outer island, opens day 7 with 180 personnel growing to 260 on day 20. The spoke's advance team asks for six 60 kW generators and nothing else. A second spoke, Spoke C on Third Island, opens day 5 with 120 personnel growing to 160 on day 15; it is on the host-nation grid and its advance team asks for bottled water. Spoke B has no grid and no fuel point, and the only surface link is a twice-weekly barge. A 30-day cut of the 90-day situation in scenarios/SKELETONS.md: the UCA clock and the funding-expiry trap run past day 30 and show in the debrief as pending.",
